<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch provisional livestock totals for 1997.</title>
<headline>Dutch provisional livestock totals for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch statistical office (CBS) has issued the following provisional livestock numbers for 1997 with comparisons against previous years.</p>
<p>					 1997	    1996	  1995</p>
<p>CATTLE (TOTAL) in millions     4.412	   4.551	 4.654</p>
<p>Inc: dairy cows		    1.584	   1.665	 1.708</p>
<p>young animals not for</p>
<p>     slaughter		     1.553	   1.603	 1.581</p>
<p>CHICKENS (TOTAL) in millions  92.697	  91.441	89.561</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
